{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1000_001har", "source_sha256": "700fe3205b6dda7f5304d3eae94e7ee7dbe0a8218c6d81f5cb46bfdd6bc228e7", "ja": "うーん、うーん……どうしよっかな～。", "zh": "嗯——嗯……该怎么办呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ed17c722e3796bc48b40b7d124fcc2d551a552fdb9377c9af4cfa214b13952ff", "ja": "おっ、春香。\nハロウィンフェスタ、お疲れ様。", "zh": "哦，春香。\n万圣节庆典辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "0db81c28e8b646bc1d5b3cf2f63ad2975e7750660965311fe09bfed6d8a4f93b", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん。\nはいっ、お疲れさまでした！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生。\n嗯，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1003_p", "source_sha256": "8db1ef0cdc8c55a1d2801b449f15e68b8335bcd8d8447d1dff91b9439f4fd4f7", "ja": "あれ？　そっちに置いてある箱に入ってるのは\n確かフェスタのとき、春香が集めてた……。", "zh": "咦？放在那边箱子里的东西，我记得是春香在庆典时收集的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "bcc7969646b012102d1ec9a25cdf739307b3472ac980a24299057572725bb693", "ja": "はい。フェスタのイベントでもらった、お菓子です。\nカボチャチョコとか、カボチャケーキとか！", "zh": "是的，是在庆典活动上拿到的点心。\n南瓜巧克力、南瓜蛋糕之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1005_p", "source_sha256": "63152708aa5dd892399fe8794f8e73f4d395c0a95b3d0324ca312d4929592a13", "ja": "フェスタでは春香は、\n奈緒や風花との仮装対決をしてたよな。", "zh": "在万圣节活动上，春香还和奈绪、风花比过装扮来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "540dd12537644e7c518ca9113a04f9f83bc3fcee709b965fc12543f4e6402b60", "ja": "そうですね。私は、地獄の女王の役でしたけど。\n人間ども、道を開けよ！　跪け～！　みたいな感じの。", "zh": "是啊。不过我演的是地狱女王。\n大概就是“人类，给我让开！跪下～！”这样的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1007_p", "source_sha256": "c26ee1bd37a7fd9c8b8ac44a728a038ae8a671724052fdb7750ca47682cf9b5f", "ja": "ああ。春香の演じる女王は大迫力で、\nお客さんからも拍手喝采だった。", "zh": "啊。春香饰演的女王气势十足，赢得了观众的热烈掌声。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "e12a27811e7b9a1ded3ba921ab4591599ca230b89fb7070444ca5e3427b38c87", "ja": "でも私、ちょっと張り切りすぎちゃったみたいで。\nみんな怖がって、近づいてこなくて……えへへ。", "zh": "不过，我好像有点太卖力了。大家都被吓到了，不敢靠近我……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "f11d2848bca235c20b6ce2e55eb950f98689432c36d06bf63a5b5dd7581697d5", "ja": "おかげでお菓子も、あんまりたくさん\nもらえなかったんですよね。", "zh": "多亏了这样，糖果也没拿到多少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1010_p", "source_sha256": "28e596932cca7246a64d540b8ad204d7225932531dad3adc130f7f7094abf700", "ja": "ははは。それは悩ましいな……\n春香が名演だったからこその悩みだ。", "zh": "哈哈哈。这还真是个伤脑筋的问题……\n正因为春香的演出太精彩，才会有这样的烦恼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1011_p", "source_sha256": "968f4c039367d46215e0b91ac32109f615ad838bf4f8b3a76f28c1108a6f48ad", "ja": "でも春香、そのことをずっと考えてたのか？\nさっき、なんだかウンウン唸ってたみたいだけど。", "zh": "不过春香，你一直在想那件事吗？\n刚才你好像一直在苦恼呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "35f2a85a196b60d62f72965e90c6ce6616b7f59bb73eb464e6e0ba582985d71c", "ja": "あっ、いえ。違うんです。\nそうじゃなくって……この、箱のお菓子のことで。", "zh": "啊，不是的。不是那样……是关于这个盒子里的点心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "79a1d2728ccc18049957b67de86ac0ac623e638963c0f9f768d4c4a1b9302da9", "ja": "せっかくもらったものだし、とっても美味しそうだから\n食べちゃいたいんですけど、でも……。", "zh": "难得收到的礼物，而且看起来特别好吃，我也很想吃掉，可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1014_001har", "source_sha256": "ce2887ca2d65085e4f3c5181345b7fd341159c2fffdde902399159576751af4e", "ja": "楽しかったハロウィンの思い出っていうか、記念の\nお菓子って思うと、食べるのがもったいない気もして。", "zh": "想到这是快乐的万圣节回忆，也算是纪念品，就觉得吃掉有点可惜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1015_p", "source_sha256": "14490c0070ed71ebc070da2b05cdea57013f7bf1d13cf94bc77a438a6755b01c", "ja": "なるほど……あ、そうだ。春香、ちょっと目を閉じて、\nハロウィンの合言葉を言ってみてくれないか。", "zh": "原来如此……啊，对了。春香，你能不能闭上眼睛，说一句万圣节的暗号？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "70d26e6cba1581d8391d63e94b1a1e1750d9ce1820c3c17c85b35a14d51a448c", "ja": "え？　目を閉じて……合言葉。\n『トリックオアトリート！』……かな？", "zh": "诶？闭上眼睛……说暗号。\n“不给糖就捣蛋！”……这样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1017_p", "source_sha256": "97f2f3dfeb594479771626d4e809b851e179d4c5e2b2998edbc859de33b51ee6", "ja": "うん。目を開けていいよ。", "zh": "嗯。可以睁开眼睛了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "1681d404eaa25f38da2740fe4bcb7e9b14c09442f72accc639985543c5f43075", "ja": "…………あっ、お菓子！\n{$P$}さんも持ってたんですか？", "zh": "…………啊，零食！\n原来连{$P$}先生也带着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1019_p", "source_sha256": "433ca4a7c74ea4c8d898bf02fa66d96239a3c596f2b844924d62ce02f1292f46", "ja": "ああ。そう言えば、俺もさっき少しもらってたんだ。\nとりあえず、これを食べないか？", "zh": "啊。说起来，我刚才也拿了一点。\n总之，要不要先吃这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "60f8842a738d598865c9fac1d362d413a1c7cc26bc2105891ca723a50b53b155", "ja": "わあ……はい！　{$P$}さん、\nありがとうございます！", "zh": "哇……好的！{$P$}先生，\n谢谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0193_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0193_1021_001har", "source_sha256": "60b1a2d9f7d4a800156eff6b19b7f5ececdaafd3d5512b2b13af5af5ab01e724", "ja": "私がもらったお菓子をどうするかは、もう少し\n悩むことにしますね！　ハッピーハロウィン♪", "zh": "我收到的糖果要怎么处理，就再让我多想想吧！万圣节快乐♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
